---
Start MCP server (JSON-RPC over stdio)

Usage: specforge mcp [ROOT]

Arguments:
  [ROOT]
          Where to find the project to serve: the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json (none yet: served once one exists there; in a handshake session a call may also serve the project its path names or init creates)
          
          [default: .]

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
